<title>USA: Frazee-Vergas ISD 23, Minn., won by Norwest.</title>
<headline>Frazee-Vergas ISD 23, Minn., won by Norwest.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwest Inv. Svcs., Inc. said it won $1.420 million of Frazee-Vergas ISD 23, Minn., general obligation building bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.22 percent.</p>
</text>
